title: $:/plugins/rimir/json-dsl/test/test-array-raw-coercion
description: json-array scalar mode with type="raw" parses each title as JSON, falling back to the original string
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki-multiple
tags: [[$:/tags/wiki-test-spec]]

title: Setup

42
+
title: 42

+
title: true

+
title: not-json

+
title: Output

\whitespace trim
<$json-obj><$json-array filter="42 true not-json" type="raw" key="items"/><$json-emit indent="0"/></$json-obj>
+
title: ExpectedResult

<p>{"items":[42,true,"not-json"]}</p>
+
title: Narrative

`type="raw"` runs each scalar through `JSON.parse`; the first two parse as a number and a boolean, while `not-json` falls back to the original string so a malformed entry doesn't break the build.
